         reflectively loaded by RequestDispatch; Android uses UrlConnectionExecutor
         instead. Only this guarded, upstream reference is a false positive.
         Evidence: https://github.com/jhy/jsoup/blob/jsoup-1.23.2/src/main/java/org/jsoup/helper/RequestDispatch.java
         Keep InvalidPackage enabled for all other classes/packages. Recheck on upgrades. -->
    <issue id="InvalidPackage">
        <ignore regexp="Invalid package reference.*java\.net\.http.*org\.jsoup\.helper\.HttpClientExecutor.*" />
    </issue>
</lint>
